1
00:00:00,432 --> 00:00:03,562
- You threw up?
- Yeah. And the craziest part is...

2
00:00:03,769 --> 00:00:08,859
(Howard:)...because there's no gravity,
the throw-up kind of floats there.

3
00:00:09,942 --> 00:00:13,942
ln a little ball,
and if your mouth is open...

4
00:00:14,154 --> 00:00:16,404
(Howard:)...because you're screaming...

5
00:00:17,741 --> 00:00:21,791
(Howard:)...sometimes it just floats right back in.

6
00:00:24,039 --> 00:00:27,039
(Howard:)Boy, does everyone laugh at you
when that happens.

7
00:00:27,251 --> 00:00:29,041
- That sounds mean.
- No.

8
00:00:29,253 --> 00:00:30,753
(Howard:)I would have laughed too...

9
00:00:30,963 --> 00:00:32,793
(Howard:)...but I didn't want
the vomit to come back out.

10
00:00:35,050 --> 00:00:37,800
Heh. Anyway...

11
00:00:38,011 --> 00:00:39,681
Oh, could you do me a favor...

12
00:00:39,888 --> 00:00:43,018
(Howard:)...and overnight me
some more underwear?

13
00:00:43,225 --> 00:00:45,355
- Sure, why?
- I got a look at the centrifuge...

14
00:00:45,561 --> 00:00:47,691
...they're gonna
spin me around in tomorrow...

15
00:00:47,896 --> 00:00:58,026
(Howard:)...and I have a hunch
I packed a little light.

